              <h3>Motives for cybercrime</h3>
<p>Now that you have learnt about what cyber crime is lets take a look at the potential motives for carrying out cyber crime.</p>

              <!-- sections.njk VIDEO! -->
              
              
              
      <div class="l-video-container">
        <video poster="~/images/svg/poster.svg" controls preload="metadata" aria-labelledby="watch" width="1000"
          data-base="cs_u1_s1_p3_motives" 
          data-ext=".mp4" 
